<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Dairy Queen Price History: 2022–2026</h1>
    <p>Most menu sites only tell you what a Blizzard costs today. The Queen Dairy Menu independently compiles and tracks year-over-year fast-food menu pricing, tracking how inflation, dairy commodities, and franchise costs affect your favorite orders. All figures represent estimated national averages.</p>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:900px">

    <h2>Medium Blizzard: five years of price creep</h2>
    <p>The medium Blizzard is DQ's benchmark item, so it's the cleanest way to see the trend. Our estimated national average has climbed from <strong>$4.29 in 2022</strong> to <strong>$5.49 in mid-2026</strong> — a rise of roughly <strong>28% in five years</strong>, well ahead of general U.S. food-away-from-home inflation over the same period.</p>

